  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Layout: the table is printed as three stacked bands, each running across the whole spread (p.68 left, p.69 right) with 年次 at the left end of p.68 and again at the right end of p.69. Joined here as three parts, each with 11 year rows: (1) 14 offices 親展 ... トラック支廳 (7 on p.68 + 7 on p.69), (2) 14 offices ポナペ支廳 ... アンガウル醫院, (3) 16 offices トラック醫院 ... 公學校 (8 + 8). Rows: 3 x 11 = 33 as printed; each office has 收受 and 發送 columns. 同 expanded in 年次.",
   "Footnote markers 1 and 2 are not visible in the heading cells on the scan; the footnotes are given as printed under the table (note 1 concerns the 親展 column, note 2 the 檢事局 columns).",
   "No totals are printed; no arithmetic checks possible.",
   "Many figures in the last column of a block (e.g. パラオ支廳 發送, トラック支廳 發送, アンガウル醫院 發送, 公學校 發送) touch the cell rules and their last digit is slightly clipped; each was read on enlarged crops and accepted where the glyph is identifiable (e.g. パラオ支廳 發送 大正12 2,869, 昭和3 3,133, 昭和5 10,023; ヤルート郵便局 大正14 收受 1,806; 觀測所 昭和2 發送 433). No cell was left unreadable.",
